  "bodyHash": "tJ3uGeMND0U=",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_28102a79-fb95-46e3-988f-759119fc0987.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"280\"></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">在末地中添加了新的矿石！</span></h1><div style=\"padding-left:120px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ABetancourt03/angelosend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2b46c0e322b5ff09b298c17cdfe6833c826ac74a.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fangelosend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72cf68d7-83b3-436c-822d-cfd343d7f304\" alt=\"\" width=\"187\" height=\"64\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fQ5Q71CX676\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4e525b7da08ae73392f08b3ef5da51ff72ef6889.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"213\" height=\"64\"></a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div style=\"padding-left:240px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b5f2bbe24d378d863f70c8b4bf7bf9c0ef2b56f7.png\" width=\"191px\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c4f1a960f18ab198a516e9e092572e3d4be63879.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"181\" height=\"64\"></a>&nbsp;</div><div style=\"padding-left:240px\">&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>也兼容 Forge 和 NeoForge</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconnector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/538973c835bf323d8b0048512d61c0ff8aa30f0b.png\" width=\"299\" height=\"72\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fforgified-fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/167dc4a406313cb19c2e4bd1493d74180ab8c591.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconnector-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/81c4efc44654ac0db30652242292978d25f882b1.png\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Fabric 版本仅需 Fabric API</strong></span></p><div style=\"padding-left:240px\">&nbsp;</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><strong><strong>矿石生成</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">在末地岛屿的 Y 坐标 20 到 35 之间生成。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/952/933/2024-08-29_00.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><strong><strong>末影合金碎片</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">将粗末影合金放入熔炉或高炉中烧炼，即可获得末影合金碎片。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/952/924/2024-08-29_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"210\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/952/925/2024-08-29_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"279\" height=\"210\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><strong><strong>末影合金锭合成配方</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">在工作台中，用 4 个末影合金碎片、1 个末地石、2 个紫颂花和 2 个爆裂紫颂果合成末影合金锭。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/952/939/2024-08-29_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"369\" height=\"206\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/952/941/2024-08-29_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"369\" height=\"205\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>其他末影合金合成配方</strong></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">粗末影合金块</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_aed282da-f2e9-42aa-8a87-dc4edd74b4ed.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">从粗末影合金块分解为粗末影合金</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_662a3810-c540-4d80-bfc4-19b03eae92a4.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">末影合金块</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_cc81578a-9c2c-4565-8816-1ac5e366b307.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">从末影合金块分解为末影合金锭</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_b062b397-90c6-4e17-b76b-6a2e068158af.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">末影合金升级锻造模板合成配方</span></strong></span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_e33dd653-9ba7-453a-96d6-1b8ebbaf99ba.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><strong>末影合金升级锻造模板生成</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">你可以在末地城的宝箱中找到它们。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/795/a3c9194546f6686d522b89c95608d9fd2982b790.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><strong><strong>将下界合金工具升级为末影合金</strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">末影合金剑</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_199203b1-d1c7-4e5f-9da2-a88368b1875e.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">末影合金镐</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_c25f0216-be00-43a2-b823-de87cc67f020.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">末影合金斧</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_0a50e90e-d22a-4cb0-ab33-9afe10ff1a74.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">末影合金锹</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_07b9a590-67a9-4371-8392-b967c8332cd6.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">末影合金锄</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_cfef119e-4cad-478e-bf8d-bc52232f408a.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">将下界合金盔甲升级为末影合金</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">末影合金头盔</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_e47ae9d9-e8ed-4224-a807-afa66cca6505.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">末影合金胸甲</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_dadc6ac4-31a0-4d94-ad68-cd1bcfe55125.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">末影合金护腿</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_f787d7c0-45bd-4a71-9a2d-3b334131a872.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">末影合金靴子</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092809/description_0f37ab29-e511-4adb-b714-71261dfbaad5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
